<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT CALIFORNIA WEST TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT CALIFORNIA WEST TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, California 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the</p>
<p>Bank of the West Classic women's tennis tournament Friday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>3-Amnda Coetzer (South Africa) beat 7-Kim Po (U.S.) 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>6-Conchita Martinez (Spain) beat 2-Monica Seles (U.S.) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-5) 6-4</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Linda Wild (U.S.) 6-1 6-7</p>
<p>(9-7) 6-3</p>
<p>4-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat Elena Likhovtseva (Russia)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-2) 6-3</p>
</text>
